00:08:06,770 --> 00:08:08,710
When a public resource generates

303
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:12,560
wealth, the public should share in

304
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,600
that wealth.

305
00:08:14,470 --> 00:08:15,790
Donald Trump has floated

306
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:17,750
the idea too: "the American

307
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,330
public essentially becomes

308
00:08:19,370 --> 00:08:21,120
a partner with the companies."

309
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,080
Neither version is law.

310
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:24,160
So when this reaches

311
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,980
your ballot, show up.

312
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:27,500
And ask everyone who wants

313
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:29,220
your vote one question:

314
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:31,280
who gets a share of the gain?

315
00:08:31,470 --> 00:08:33,050
Otherwise, others divide

316
00:08:33,090 --> 00:08:34,090
it without you.

317
00:08:35,110 --> 00:08:35,830
And there may be

318
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:37,720
a great deal to share.

319
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,550
Inside one AI company,

320
00:08:39,590 --> 00:08:40,990
9 in 10 of the staff

321
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:42,190
expect AI to be

322
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:44,310
capable of a Nobel-level discovery

323
00:08:44,350 --> 00:08:46,130
before this decade is out.

324
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:47,700
They have a stake in that.

325
00:08:47,950 --> 00:08:49,990
But if even part of it comes true,

326
00:08:50,070 --> 00:08:51,790
these years bring discoveries,

327
00:08:51,830 --> 00:08:53,070
not only risks.

328
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,620
So suppose all of it works:

329
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:57,410
the discoveries, the rules,

330
00:08:57,450 --> 00:08:58,480
the shared gain.

331
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,640
That leaves the hardest question,

332
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:02,510
the one no ballot can settle.

333
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,030
5 years from now,

334
00:09:04,070 --> 00:09:05,050
at another wedding,

335
00:09:05,090 --> 00:09:06,960
a stranger asks what you do.

336
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,310
Who do you want to be,

337
00:09:09,350 --> 00:09:10,550
when nobody needs you

338
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:11,750
for your thinking?

339
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,830
It can sound like a loss.

340
00:09:14,070 --> 00:09:15,270
But listen again:

341
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,240
it is the question

342
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,640
we ask children.

343
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:19,040
What do you want to be?

344
00:09:19,330 --> 00:09:20,640
For most of history,

345
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,930
a change this big

346
00:09:21,970 --> 00:09:23,510
was left to the children.

347
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:26,390
This one is yours: the warning,

348
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:28,270
the work, and the wonder.

349
00:09:29,330 --> 00:09:30,230
There is no next

350
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,910
generation to wait for.

351
00:09:32,090 --> 00:09:33,390
This time, the next

352
00:09:33,430 --> 00:09:35,060
generation is you.

353
00:09:36,210 --> 00:09:37,320
This channel exists

354
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,680
so that superintelligence

355
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,420
goes well for everybody.

356
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:42,880
For this generation, and the next.

357
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:44,030
Want that too?

358
00:09:44,110 --> 00:09:45,190
Then subscribe.

